OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers across the far north
OL,6,Fand eastern areas, heaviest in the far
OL,7,Fsoutheast. Elsewhere, mainly dry with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Temperatures near
OL,9,Faverage, though brisk northeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds will make it feel cold in the
OL,11,Feast and southeast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudier across many eastern
OL,14,Fareas and the far north with a few
OL,15,Fblustery showers. Elsewhere, mainly
OL,16,Fdry with clear spells. Patchy fog and
OL,17,Flocal frost are possible in the
OL,18,Fnorthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
