OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FMist and fog patches in the
OL,6,Fnorth clearing. Otherwise, variable
OL,7,Fcloud with scattered light showers,
OL,8,Fmost frequent in the far southeast.
OL,9,FModerate winds in the south.
OL,10,FTemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
